<title>CANADA: Second Cup to be Air Canada supplier.</title>
<headline>Second Cup to be Air Canada supplier.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Cup Ltd said it will become Air Canada's official coffee supplier under a three-year agreement.</p>
<p>Some Air Canada flights will start serving Second Cup coffee before year end and all flights will provide it starting in early 1997. No other details were disclosed.    -- Reuters</p>
<p>Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
